version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - Paraguay
  - real-estate
  - geojson
  - open-data
  - mapper
  - cadastre
  - agriculture
  - biodiversity
abstract: >-
  A free, open national viewer for Paraguay real-estate and geographic
  data. 5,784 properties scraped from 3 public sources (InfoCasas, TuLugar,
  Asunción.estate); 16 cities; 17 PY deptos; full price+USR+PYG, area,
  bedrooms, bathrooms, lots, and Pro-tier risk indices.
